## 6. C2-A-only corridor diff (evidence relabel)

`corridor.py` already contained uncommitted V1 display changes before C2-A.
The whole-worktree corridor diff above is therefore not a C2-A-only diff. The
pre-C2A baseline was reconstructed in `/tmp` from HEAD plus the corridor.py
part of V1 `v0_v1_changes.patch`; its hash matches V1 `source_hashes.txt`.

```bash
PRE=/tmp/c2a_pre_v1_check/catkin_ws/src/fwis_v3_optimizer/src/fwis_v3_optimizer/formation_continuous_a/corridor.py
sha256sum "$PRE"
# c1c9142129a3102144a796b0b7229abef7423d82c3dc2dbcbc4146a32b4ba715
cp "$PRE" evaluation/virtual_a_corridor/C2A/20261117T120249Z/pre_c2a_v1_corridor.py
sha256sum evaluation/virtual_a_corridor/C2A/20261117T120249Z/pre_c2a_v1_corridor.py
# c1c9142129a3102144a796b0b7229abef7423d82c3dc2dbcbc4146a32b4ba715
git diff --no-index --numstat /tmp/c2a_head_corridor.py "$PRE"
# HEAD -> pre-C2A V1 delta: 86	1
diff -u --label a/catkin_ws/src/fwis_v3_optimizer/src/fwis_v3_optimizer/formation_continuous_a/corridor.py \
  --label b/catkin_ws/src/fwis_v3_optimizer/src/fwis_v3_optimizer/formation_continuous_a/corridor.py \
  "$PRE" catkin_ws/src/fwis_v3_optimizer/src/fwis_v3_optimizer/formation_continuous_a/corridor.py \
  > source_diff_c2a_corridor_only.diff
git diff --no-index --numstat "$PRE" \
  catkin_ws/src/fwis_v3_optimizer/src/fwis_v3_optimizer/formation_continuous_a/corridor.py
# C2-A-only delta: 456	1
sha256sum source_diff_c2a_corridor_only.diff
# e04bf39682f564f30b2d4c70bff443ac1c99d501898b90772257e083d5c34cd1
```

The old name `source_diff_c2a_corridor.diff` previously held the whole-HEAD
diff; it was renamed to `source_diff_corridor_from_head_including_v1.diff`,
not deleted. A regenerated `git diff HEAD` of the final worktree is
byte-identical to the renamed file (SHA-256 `9edd2eed...`):

```bash
git diff -- catkin_ws/src/fwis_v3_optimizer/src/fwis_v3_optimizer/formation_continuous_a/corridor.py \
  > /tmp/c2a_whole_now.diff
sha256sum /tmp/c2a_whole_now.diff
# 9edd2eed1a0b8ac7c501d30e2eca03417052c6395667250fb7b7baeab3229c23
cmp -s /tmp/c2a_whole_now.diff source_diff_corridor_from_head_including_v1.diff
# cmp_exit=0
```

